  "prevalence_note": "dimensions with fewer than 10 gold positives report counts and kappa only. The fixture corpus is negation-dense and hedge-poor, so `uncertain` in particular is too thin here to score \u2014 scope_accuracy.json remains its only quantitative evidence.",
